    ["　　廷根晨报，入室抢劫杀人案\n\n　　……据警察部门透露，韦尔奇先生的家里场面惨不忍睹，并且丢失了所有的黄金、珠宝和钞票，以及一切值钱的、便于拿走的物品，甚至连铜便士都没有剩下。有理由相信，这是一伙残忍凶恶的歹徒，他们会毫不犹豫杀掉看见了他们长相的无辜者，比如韦尔奇先生，比如娜娅女士。\n\n　　这是对王国法律的践踏！这是对公共安全的挑衅！没有人希望遭遇类似的事情！当然，一个好消息是，警察部门已经锁定了凶手，抓到了主犯，我们将尽快给出后续报道。\n\n　　记者：约翰·勃朗宁"] = "Tingen Morning Post, Home Invasion and Murder Case \n \n ... According to the police department, the scene at Mr. Welch's home was horrific. All the gold, jewelry, and banknotes were missing, as well as everything valuable and easy to carry, not even a single copper penny was left. There is reason to believe that this is a group of cruel and vicious criminals who would not hesitate to kill innocent people who saw their faces, such as Mr. Welch and Ms. Naya. \n \n This is a trampling of the kingdom's laws! This is a provocation to public safety! No one wishes to encounter such things! Of course, one piece of good news is that the police department has identified the culprits and caught the main perpetrator. We will provide follow-up reports as soon as possible. \n \n Reporter: John Browning",
